2026-11-07T11:51:10.5892879Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
2026-11-07T11:51:10.5893676Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
2026-11-07T11:51:10.5894418Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
2026-11-07T11:51:10.5894943Z  - install Nix in /nix
2026-11-07T11:51:10.5895453Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
2026-11-07T11:51:10.5896198Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
2026-11-07T11:51:10.5897471Z    /root
2026-11-07T11:51:10.5916317Z  - back up /etc/bash.bashrc to /etc/bash.bashrc.backup-before-nix
2026-11-07T11:51:10.5917540Z  - update /etc/bash.bashrc to include some Nix configuration
2026-11-07T11:51:10.5929350Z  - load and start a service (at /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.service
2026-11-07T11:51:10.5930110Z    and /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.socket) for nix-daemon
2026-11-07T11:51:10.5930635Z 
